WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/charging/components/cost-analysis/LifetimeSummary.tsx — a PURE presentational leaf.
    Props: lifetimeMetrics: LifetimeMetrics | null, coreStats: CoreStats | null.
    GlassPanel(glow=cyan, p-4) → header[ TrendingUp(cyan) + "Lifetime Summary" ]
      → (lifetimeMetrics && coreStats)
          ? grid (2/3 cols) of 7 LifetimeMetric tiles
          : centered "No data".
    Tiles (exact expressions, render order):
      1 Total Spent        = formatCurrency(coreStats.totalCost, 2)
      2 Total Energy       = fmtWithUnit(coreStats.totalEnergy, 'kWh', 1)
      3 Total Sessions     = fmtInt(coreStats.count)
      4 Avg Session Cost   = formatCurrency(lifetimeMetrics.avgSessionCost, 2)
      5 Avg Energy/Session = fmtWithUnit(lifetimeMetrics.avgSessionEnergy, 'kWh', 1)
      6 Avg Duration       = `${fmtNumber(lifetimeMetrics.avgDuration, 0)} min`
      7 Free Sessions      = `${fmtInt(freeCount)} (${fmtWithUnit(freeEnergy, 'kWh', 1)})`
    Data hooks (per prompt): useTranslation, useFormatting (formatCurrency = `${symbol}${fmtNumber(amount,d)}`,
    symbol default `$`). Number ports: fmtNumber/fmtInt/fmtWithUnit (lib/numberFormat — safeNumber→0, en-US,
    default precision 2).

